---
layout: base.njk
title: Colours
description: Design token colour ramps and semantic assignments.
---

<style>
  .color-ramp {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(10, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-2xs);
    margin-block: var(--space-md);
  }
  .swatch {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: var(--swatch-bg);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding: var(--space-3xs);
  }
  .swatch > span {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: oklch(30% 0 0 / 0.5);
  }
  .swatch-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .swatch-sm {
    inline-size: 2rem;
    block-size: 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
</style>

<section class="section flow">
  <h1>Colours</h1>
  <p>Primitive ramps (5 hues × 10 steps) and semantic tokens. All values in <code>oklch()</code>.</p>

  <h2>Brand</h2>
  <div class="color-ramp">
    <div class="swatch" style="--swatch-bg: var(--color-brand-50);"><span>50</span></div>
    <div class="swatch" style="--swatch-bg: var(--color-brand-100);"><span>100</span></div>
    <div class="swatch" style="--swatch-bg: var(--color-brand-200);"><span>200</span></div>
    <div class="swatch" style="--swatch-bg: var(--color-brand-300);"><span>300</span></div>
    <div class="swatch" style="--swatch-bg: var(--color-brand-400);"><span>400</span></div>
    <div class="swatch" style="--swatch-bg: var(--color-brand-500);"><span>500</span></div>
    <div class="swatch" style="--swatch-bg: var(--color-brand-600);"><span>600</span></div>
    <div class="swatch" style="--swatch-bg: var(--color-brand-700);"><span>700</span></div>
    <div class="swatch" style="--swatch-bg: var(--color-brand-800);"><span>800</span></div>
    <div class="swatch" style="--swatch-bg: var(--color-brand-900);"><span>900</span></div>
  </div>

